From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:17:44 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): reconcile scroll offset when the scroller viewport
 changes

When a ScrollView frame changed (e.g. the IME shrinks a chat list),
KNode only corrected composeOffset in two narrow cases and could leave it
out of sync with the native offset. Clamp composeOffset to the native
offset within the new max offset, keep a pending programmatic target
untouched during the resize, and replay that target after the smaller
native frame has been committed.

Fork-Patch: compose-viewport-offset-correction
